        "type": "group"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "775b7u7u34n8bgg",
                "text": "Beta Decay"
              }
            ],
            "id": "8dkqpj9b8tdhlc4",
            "type": "h1"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": ""
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Beta decay"
                  }
                ],
                "content": [
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "A type of radioactive decay in which an unstable nucleus transforms by emitting a beta particle. Beta decay results in the change of the atomic number of the nucleus without a significant change in its mass number."
                      }
                    ],
                    "id": "4197781457",
                    "type": "p"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "3513987723",
                "trigger": "hover",
                "type": "popup"
              },
              {
                "text": " is the emission of an electron from a nucleus. Iodine-131 is an example of a nuclide that undergoes "
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": ""
                  }
                ],
                "legacyBlockRendered": false,
                "src": "\\beta",
                "subtype": "latex",
                "type": "formula_inline"
              },
              {
                "text": " decay:"
              }
            ],
            "id": "kwvje9ypgtoqdcp",
            "type": "p"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "msitr0tb3obxqu8",
                "text": " ",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "la4g26zma86svmn",
            "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
            "src": "{}_{\\;53}^{131}\\mathrm I\\;\\rightarrow{}_{-1}^{\\;\\;0}\\mathrm e\\;+\\;{}_{\\;54}^{131}\\mathrm{Xe}\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\mathrm{or}\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;{}_{\\;53}^{131}\\mathrm I\\;\\rightarrow{}_{-1}^{\\;\\;0}\\mathrm\\beta\\;+\\;{}_{\\;54}^{131}\\mathrm{Xe}",
            "subtype": "latex",
            "type": "formula"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "Beta decay, which can be thought of as converting a neutron into a proton and a "
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": ""
                  }
                ],
                "legacyBlockRendered": false,
                "src": "\\beta",
                "subtype": "latex",
                "type": "formula_inline"
              },
              {
                "text": " particle, is observed in neutron-rich nuclides (large n:p ratio). Such nuclei lie above the band of stability. The beta particle (electron) emitted is from the atomic nucleus and is not one of the electrons surrounding the nucleus. The emission of an electron does not change the mass number of the nuclide but does increase the number of its protons and decrease the number of its neutrons. Consequently, the n:p ratio is decreased, and the daughter nuclide lies closer to the band of stability than the parent nuclide."
              }
            ],
            "id": "f8owm4sux8hn1jv",
            "type": "p"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "mw6gm2d29vqhc0f",
                "text": " ",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "ce25c2wp2wetv8o",
            "src": "https://d2xvti2irp4c7t.cloudfront.net/media/da/da64aeaa859532e3a3be75ed00a3841a/beta_decay.png",
            "type": "img",
            "width": 550
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": ""
              }
            ],
            "id": "3569147574",
            "type": "p"
          }
        ],
        "id": "197024699",
        "selection": {
          "anchor": {
